[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]　•  张英领兵至牛渚，「积粮十万于邸[color=#000000]音羝[/color]阁」（独有音注"音羝"）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]　•  [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "黄盖", "cat": "people"}]黄盖[/url][/color]与张英交战，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "蒋钦", "cat": "people"}]蒋钦[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "周泰", "cat": "people"}]周泰[/url][/color]趁机营中放火，张英军大乱败逃[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]　•  张英败回刘繇处，「繇[color=#000000]责骂[/color]张英等，欲斩之」，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "笮融", "cat": "people"}]笮融[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "薛礼", "cat": "people"}]薛礼[/url][/color]劝免，屯兵零陵城拒策[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
